{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685", "id": 414733124, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU0MTQ3MzMxMjQ=", "number": 685, "title": "calibration without STATUSTEXT commands", "user": {"login": "michprev", "id": 7281754, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcyODE3NTQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7281754?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev", "html_url": "https://github.com/michprev", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/michprev/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2019-02-26T17:35:35Z", "updated_at": "2019-05-16T08:00:58Z", "closed_at": "2019-05-16T07:50:43Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "While building my own flight stack I have hit an issue with calibration.\n\n```C\nvoid calibration_callback(const Calibration::Result result, const Calibration::ProgressData progress)\n{\ncout << \"progress \" << progress.progress << \" result \" << (int)result << endl;\n}\n\n...\n\nauto calibration = make_shared<Calibration>(system);\ncalibration->calibrate_accelerometer_async(calibration_callback);\n```\n\nThe situation is:\n\n1. my quad receives [COMMAND_LONG](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG) with [MAV_CMD_PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION) id\n1. it starts sending [COMMAND_ACK](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_ACK) with MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS as result\n1. In the end it sends one [COMMAND_ACK](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_ACK) with MAV_RESULT_ACCEPTED\n\nI am not sending [STATUSTEXT](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#STATUSTEXT) commands\n\nThe issues are:\n\n1. The callback is never called. I think that it is related to\nhttps://github.com/Dronecode/DronecodeSDK/blob/e5d4e0e8510cd02bfbfe5d629e1a2e4ff49549c9/core/mavlink_commands.cpp#L180-L198\nCommands with MAV_RESULT_IN_PROGRESS result do not get propagated - that it known issue. The problem is that `calibration_callback` is not called even when the last command with MAV_RESULT_ACCEPTED is received. That can be fixed by inserting something like\n`call_user_callback(_calibration_callback, Calibration::Result ::SUCCESS, Calibration::ProgressData(false, NAN, false, \"\"));` here:\nhttps://github.com/Dronecode/DronecodeSDK/blob/e5d4e0e8510cd02bfbfe5d629e1a2e4ff49549c9/plugins/calibration/calibration_impl.cpp#L203-L205\n1. It is not possible to run the calibration for the second time simply because `_state` is still set to `State::ACCELEROMETER_CALIBRATION`. It should be cleared `_state = State::NONE;` here:\nhttps://github.com/Dronecode/DronecodeSDK/blob/e5d4e0e8510cd02bfbfe5d629e1a2e4ff49549c9/plugins/calibration/calibration_impl.cpp#L203-L205\n\nIf the current implementation is working for you then it is probably because the flight stack also sends [STATUSTEXT](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#STATUSTEXT) commands.\nhttps://github.com/Dronecode/DronecodeSDK/blob/e5d4e0e8510cd02bfbfe5d629e1a2e4ff49549c9/plugins/calibration/calibration_impl.cpp#L261-L338\n\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/467943366", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/685#issuecomme